{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00687","headline":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第三奏 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第三奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元符传紫极，宝祚啓高真。\n道德先垂裕，冲和已化淳。\n人风齐太古，天瑞叶惟新。\n仙乐清都上，长明交泰辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}